/- A word is encoded by its letters, least significant bit first, followed by a terminal
1-bit. Dropping that final bit retains initial and final occurrences of `a`. -/
private def wordValue (w : ℕ) : Equiv.Perm (Fin 275) :=
  (w.bits.dropLast.map (fun t ↦ if t then b else a)).prod

